<title>JAPAN: Dollar likely to settle down soon - Sakakibara.</title>
<headline>Dollar likely to settle down soon - Sakakibara.</headline>
<dateline>FUKUOKA, Japan 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar is likely to settle down soon, Eisuke Sakakibara, director-general of the Japanese Finance Ministry's International Finance Bureau, told reporters on Monday.</p>
<p>Asked about the dollar's recent fall, Sakakibara said:</p>
<p>&quot;The dollar is likely to settle down soon.&quot;</p>
</text>
